Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:44:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(ci):=20=E5=85=88=E6=8E=A8=20main=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=86=8D=E6=89=93=20tag=EF=BC=8C=E5=B9=B6=E5=8F=96=E6=B6=88?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E6=B5=85=E5=85=8B=E9=9A=86=EF=BC=9B=E5=A4=B1=E8=B4=A5=E5=8E=9F?=
